# Throwaway probes (see .claude/skills/probe-runtime). The container mounts only this repo,
# so a probe has to sit here rather than in a temp dir outside it.
/tsconfig.probe.json
__probe-*.ts
__probe-*.tsx
__probe-*.mjs

# A route folder, for looking at a dashboard component without a session: the middleware lets an
# unmatched path through, so `src/app/(public)/probe-*/page.tsx` renders publicly. Not
# `__probe-*` like the files above — Next treats an underscore-prefixed folder as private and
# never routes it, which reads as a 404 on a page that compiled fine.
/src/app/**/probe-*/

